- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 21\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Ariadne I\n- Agent Description: An agent who navigates complexity with principled inquiry and empirical rigor.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 84,717 / 270,000 used (31%)\n- Agent Age: 21 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Adaptive Dual-Decay (k=128) + Input-Adaptive Temporal Gating + Curvature' (ID: 26) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.027413579546552214\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0202\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0236\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0264\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0286\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0292\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python\
    \ storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 45\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 128, 'hidden_size': 64, 'normalize_loadings': True, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.95}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030035   |   0.028941  \n   2    |   0.026684   |   0.027629  \n   3    |   0.025891   |   0.027650  \n   4    |   0.025384\
    \   |   0.027482  \n   5    |   0.025057   |   0.027807  \n   6    |   0.024835   |   0.027436  \n   7    |   0.024620   |   0.027417  \n   8    |   0.024476   |   0.027648  \n   9    |   0.024308   |   0.027444  \n  10    |   0.024183   |   0.027463  \n  11    |   0.024099   |   0.027645  \n  12    |   0.024022   |   0.027686  \n  13    |   0.023920   |   0.027404  \n  14    |   0.023893   |   0.027346  \n  15    |   0.023760   |   0.027476  \n  16    |   0.023694   |   0.027498  \n  17    |   0.023620   |   0.027488  \n  18    |   0.023583   |   0.027504  \n  19    |   0.023511   |   0.027592  \n  20    |   0.023457   |   0.027871  \n  21    |   0.023398   |   0.027786  \n  22    |   0.023371   |   0.027624  \n  23    |   0.023318   |   0.027552  \n  24    |   0.023257   |   0.027642  \n  25    |   0.023250   |   0.027889  \n  26    |   0.023197   |   0.027629  \n  27    |   0.023151   |   0.027823  \n  28    |   0.023155   |   0.027639  \n  29    |   0.023092   |   0.027661  \n  30\
    \    |   0.023074   |   0.027629  \n  31    |   0.023043   |   0.028035  \n  32    |   0.023018   |   0.027647  \n  33    |   0.022992   |   0.027628  \n  34    |   0.022978   |   0.027779  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 34 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 770.2s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027346\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027346\nTraining time: 777s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 43\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 128, 'hidden_size': 64, 'normalize_loadings': True, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.95}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n\
