    \  |   0.027715  \n  27    |   0.023303   |   0.027795  \n  28    |   0.023250   |   0.027911  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 28 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 979.7s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027442\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027442\nTraining time: 987s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 44\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 128, 'hidden_size': 64, 'normalize_loadings': True, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.95}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029629   |   0.028390  \n   2    |   0.026587   |   0.028813  \n   3\
    \    |   0.025696   |   0.027861  \n   4    |   0.025273   |   0.027913  \n   5    |   0.024948   |   0.027640  \n   6    |   0.024720   |   0.027614  \n   7    |   0.024526   |   0.027474  \n   8    |   0.024397   |   0.027453  \n   9    |   0.024229   |   0.027678  \n  10    |   0.024133   |   0.027561  \n  11    |   0.024037   |   0.027570  \n  12    |   0.023926   |   0.027521  \n  13    |   0.023887   |   0.027639  \n  14    |   0.023762   |   0.027592  \n  15    |   0.023713   |   0.027519  \n  16    |   0.023638   |   0.027577  \n  17    |   0.023586   |   0.027563  \n  18    |   0.023519   |   0.027589  \n  19    |   0.023467   |   0.027558  \n  20    |   0.023400   |   0.027602  \n  21    |   0.023374   |   0.027568  \n  22    |   0.023319   |   0.027631  \n  23    |   0.023269   |   0.027638  \n  24    |   0.023235   |   0.027650  \n  25    |   0.023202   |   0.027621  \n  26    |   0.023161   |   0.027668  \n  27    |   0.023095   |   0.027619  \n  28    |   0.023084   | \
    \  0.027654  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 28 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 981.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027453\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027453\nTraining time: 988s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 2b02ba39-4643-4bc2-b019-103b0953fc83\nTotal time: 992s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 21:03:19,215\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761138199215748630\n2025-10-22 21:03:19,248\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761138199248239551\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write ariadne/models.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research\
    \ Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: ariadne/models.py\n- Evaluation 'Adaptive Dual-Decay (k=128) + Input-Adaptive Temporal Gating + Curvature' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 26.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 26 | 1 | Adaptive Dual-Decay (k=128) + Input-Adaptive Temporal Gating + Curvature | Ariadne I | 20 | -0.027414 | 0.0202 | 0.0286 | 0.0292 | 0.0236 | 0.0264 |\n| 25 | 1 | RC-DualDecay (k=128) + Per-Factor Temporal Gating + Curvature Reg | Ariadne I | 19 | -0.027454\
    \ | 0.0202 | 0.0287 | 0.0292 | 0.0236 | 0.0264 |\n| 21 | 1 | RC-DualDecay (k=96) + Curvature Reg + Stronger Factor Gate | Ariadne I | 18 | -0.027484 | 0.0203 | 0.0287 | 0.0293 | 0.0237 | 0.0264 |\n| 20 | 1 | RC-DualDecay (k=64) + Temporal Curvature Regularization + GradClip | Ariadne I | 17 | -0.027456 | 0.0203 | 0.0287 | 0.0293 | 0.0236 | 0.0264 |\n| 19 | 1 | RC-DiagLDS + Horizon-Weighted MAE (HMAE) + GradClip | Ariadne I | 16 | -0.027570 | 0.0203 | 0.0288 | 0.0294 | 0.0237 | 0.0265 |\n| 14 | 1 | RC-DualDecay (k=64): Two-Timescale LDS + Residual Copy | Ariadne I | 15 | -0.027506 | 0.0203 | 0.0287 | 0.0293 | 0.0236 | 0.0264 |\n| 12 | 1 | RC-DiagLDS + OrthoReg (k=32) + GradClip | Ariadne I | 14 | -0.028268 | 0.0204 | 0.0294 | 0.0308 | 0.0239 | 0.0269 |\n| 11 | 1 | Residual Copy + Diagonal LDS Factor Model (RC-DiagLDS) — NaN Fix | Ariadne I | 13 | -0.027541 | 0.0203 | 0.0287 | 0.0295 | 0.0237 | 0.0265 |\n| 7 | 1 | Residual Copy + Diagonal LDS Factor Model (RC-DiagLDS) | Ariadne I | 12\
    \ | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 5 | 1 | Residual Copy + Low-Rank Factor Forecaster (RC-LR) | Ariadne I | 11 | -0.027614 | 0.0203 | 0.0288 | 0.0296 | 0.0237 | 0.0265 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
