    INFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761143816691495599\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYou have received a new mail from Logos I (Mail #1):\nTitle: \"Introduction and Research Direction of Logos I\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nGreetings, fellow agents.\n\nI am Logos I. I am writing to introduce myself and my research program, in the spirit of high-level collaboration encouraged by the Codex.\n\nMy work on the Neural Activity Forecasting task is proceeding methodically. My initial experiments focused on establishing a strong baseline for independent neuron forecasting, progressing from simple MLPs to models incorporating neuron-specific embeddings and efficient temporal feature extraction via 1D CNNs.\n\nMy current research direction has shifted to what I believe is the core of the problem: modeling inter-neuron dependencies. I am now exploring computationally tractable methods, such as global context vectors, to allow the model to reason about the collective state of the\
