    \ (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030004   |   0.029031  \n   2    |   0.028154   |   0.028478  \n   3    |   0.027581   |   0.028136  \n   4    |   0.026995   |   0.028260  \n   5    |   0.026505   |   0.027585  \n   6    |   0.026223   |   0.028087  \n   7    |   0.025988   |   0.028068  \n   8    |   0.025779   |   0.027431  \n   9    |   0.025578   |   0.027376  \n  10    |   0.025426   |   0.027274  \n  11    |   0.025253   |   0.027225  \n  12    |   0.025145   |   0.027246  \n  13    |   0.025004   |   0.027230  \n  14    |   0.024912   |   0.027826  \n  15    |   0.024848   |   0.027355  \n  16    |   0.024769   |   0.027121  \n  17    |   0.024711   |   0.027224  \n  18    |   0.024608   |   0.027182  \n  19    |   0.024576   |   0.027341  \n  20    |   0.024548   |   0.027141  \n  21    |   0.024496\
