    | 67 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 38 | -0.026976 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 83 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoOsc-T (k=320, p=32, Q=3): Time-varying mixture-of-oscillators gating + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 45 | -0.026995 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 57 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 34 | -0.027011 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0286 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n| 75 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad++ (k=320, p=32): Mean+Velocity Context; γ_end=0.995; a_max=0.997; V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 42 | -0.027017 | 0.0198 | 0.0282 | 0.0290 | 0.0231 | 0.0260 |\n| 77 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoOsc (k=320, p=32, Q=3): Mixture-of-Oscillators per factor + V-OrthoReg + γ_end=0.99 | Ariadne I | 43 | -0.027023 | 0.0198 | 0.0282 | 0.0290 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 64 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32) + V-OrthoReg λ=2e-5 | Ariadne I | 36 | -0.027024 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0287 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 51 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad\
