    \ + Oscillatory SSM | Ariadne I | 32 | -0.027031 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0287 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 48 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32): Balanced Capacity + Curvature | Ariadne I | 31 | -0.027052 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0289 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 80 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoL (k=320, p=32, J=2): Mixture-of-Loadings prototypes + V-OrthoReg + γ_end=0.99 | Ariadne I | 44 | -0.027058 | 0.0198 | 0.0283 | 0.0289 | 0.0232 | 0.0261 |\n| 88 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=1.00) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 47 | -0.027059 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
