    \  \n  30    |   0.024205   |   0.027210  \n  31    |   0.024154   |   0.027221  \n  32    |   0.024157   |   0.027436  \n  33    |   0.024106   |   0.027480  \n  34    |   0.024108   |   0.027240  \n  35    |   0.024102   |   0.027230  \n  36    |   0.024091   |   0.027237  \n  37    |   0.024077   |   0.027574  \n  38    |   0.024044   |   0.027575  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 38 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1481.8s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027105\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027105\nTraining time: 1490s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 43\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'hidden_size': 64, 'normalize_u': True, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.985}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721)\
