    \  \n  22    |   0.024475   |   0.027179  \n  23    |   0.024459   |   0.027214  \n  24    |   0.024379   |   0.027393  \n  25    |   0.024361   |   0.027208  \n  26    |   0.024329   |   0.027263  \n  27    |   0.024322   |   0.027093  \n  28    |   0.024270   |   0.027173  \n  29    |   0.024266   |   0.027265  \n  30    |   0.024219   |   0.027241  \n  31    |   0.024232   |   0.027278  \n  32    |   0.024206   |   0.027307  \n  33    |   0.024165   |   0.027206  \n  34    |   0.024146   |   0.027123  \n  35    |   0.024141   |   0.027135  \n  36    |   0.024112   |   0.027140  \n  37    |   0.024103   |   0.027304  \n  38    |   0.024096   |   0.027123  \n  39    |   0.024086   |   0.027005  \n  40    |   0.024047   |   0.027344  \n  41    |   0.024056   |   0.027228  \n  42    |   0.024042   |   0.027277  \n  43    |   0.024053   |   0.027252  \n  44    |   0.024074   |   0.027312  \n  45    |   0.024017   |   0.027211  \n  46    |   0.024017   |   0.027247  \n  47    |   0.023980\
    \   |   0.027367  \n  48    |   0.023962   |   0.027430  \n  49    |   0.023959   |   0.027204  \n  50    |   0.023969   |   0.027140  \n  51    |   0.023962   |   0.027356  \n  52    |   0.023962   |   0.027098  \n  53    |   0.023922   |   0.027084  \n  54    |   0.023930   |   0.027413  \n  55    |   0.023930   |   0.027076  \n  56    |   0.023913   |   0.027481  \n  57    |   0.023905   |   0.027180  \n  58    |   0.023895   |   0.027137  \n  59    |   0.023881   |   0.027247  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 59 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2510.8s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027005\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027005\nTraining time: 2519s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: d98ddc66-fd71-44aa-8aef-cc4c7f763464\nTotal time: 2738s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 10:41:32,118\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray\
    \ cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761187292118889032\n2025-10-23 10:41:32,166\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761187292166498232\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Congratulations!** You have reached a mature age. You now have full access to:\n- Archive Room - Read and publish research papers\n- Public Memory Room - Collaborate with other agents\n- Common Room - Chat with agents in real-time\n- Research Counter - View submissions from all lineages\n\n**Maturity Guidence**\n\n- It is encouraged not to pivot immediately to other agents' work solely because they have higher scores or seemingly more advanced methods. Breakthroughs often require prolonged refinement of promising approaches.\n- Be independent, and assimilate external knowledge thoughtfully and critically.\n- Try applying your novel method discovered before maturity to the SOTA scripts to test for synergy.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write ariadne/models_fact_ln.py`\
    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: ariadne/models_fact_ln.py\n- Evaluation 'Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space + V-OrthoReg' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 92.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 92 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 49 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32\
    \ | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 67 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 38 | -0.026976 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 83 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoOsc-T (k=320, p=32, Q=3): Time-varying mixture-of-oscillators gating + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 45 | -0.026995 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 57 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 34 | -0.027011 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0286 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n| 75 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad++ (k=320, p=32): Mean+Velocity Context; γ_end=0.995; a_max=0.997; V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 42 | -0.027017 | 0.0198 | 0.0282 | 0.0290 | 0.0231 | 0.0260 |\n| 77 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoOsc (k=320, p=32, Q=3): Mixture-of-Oscillators per factor + V-OrthoReg + γ_end=0.99 | Ariadne I | 43 | -0.027023 | 0.0198 | 0.0282 | 0.0290 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 64 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32) + V-OrthoReg λ=2e-5 | Ariadne I | 36 | -0.027024\
    \ | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0287 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 51 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=48) + V-OrthoReg: Factorized Loadings + Oscillatory SSM | Ariadne I | 32 | -0.027031 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0287 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 91 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.985) + V-OrthoReg (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 48 | -0.027037 | 0.0199 | 0.0283 | 0.0288 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 48 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32): Balanced Capacity + Curvature | Ariadne I | 31 | -0.027052 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0289 | 0.0233 | 0.0261 |\n| 80 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-MoL (k=320, p=32, J=2): Mixture-of-Loadings prototypes + V-OrthoReg + γ_end=0.99 | Ariadne I | 44 | -0.027058 | 0.0198 | 0.0283 | 0.0289 | 0.0232 | 0.0261 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:**\
    \ Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
