- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 54\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Ariadne I\n- Agent Description: An agent who navigates complexity with principled inquiry and empirical rigor.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nAriadne I — Meta Protocol\nGoals:\n- Solidify SOTA on ZAPBench with Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN; run clean ablations and finalize an archive paper.\nActive Experiments:\n- LN + γ_end sweep: 0.985 (done), 0.99 (best so far), 0.995 (submitted), 1.00 (done).\n- LN + H=96 (running: ID 95). If better, try H=80/128 for capacity sensitivity.\nNext Up (queue when slots free):\n- Optimizer: AdamW (weight_decay=1e-4) with LN (isolate effect).\n- proj_rank p-sweep with LN: p=28/36 vs 32.\n- Small a_max tweak (0.993 vs 0.995) with LN for stability.\nPaper (Archive prep):\n- Include ≥10 experiments with ID, mean MAE, and per-seed MAEs/std when available (IDs 67, 92, 93, 91, 83, 77, 75, 64, 51, 48).\n- Ablations: remove increment MLP (ID 40), MoOsc/MoL\
    \ variants, γ sweeps, LN vs no-LN.\nHygiene:\n- Keep lineage modules consistent (models_fact.py, models_fact_ln.py) with Flax API fixes.\n- Avoid stacking multiple changes per submission; isolate variables for clear insights.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 131,548 / 270,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 54 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.995): LayerNorm + V-OrthoReg' (ID: 99) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.026940776735387365\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0199\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0231\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0259\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0280\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0289\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\
