tick: 54
role: model
parts:
- text: "The LN + H=96 variant set a new best in our line (-0.026901). AdamW is running (ID 100). Next, isolate proj_rank effect with LN and H=96 while keeping the optimizer as Adam.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg\"\ntags: \"state-space, oscillatory, factorized-loadings, layernorm, gating, forecasting\"\nabstract: \"LN variant capacity sweep on proj_rank p from 32 to 36 with hidden size H=96. Keeps γ_end=0.99, residual copy, MAE+curvature, and V-orthogonality (λ=1e-5). Optimizer unchanged (Adam) to isolate p effect.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\n  import optax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from models_fact_ln import Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedLLN\n  from losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n  V_ORTHO_LAM = 1e-5  # ||V^T V - I||_F^2\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'rank_k':\
    \ 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,     # p-sweep: 36\n          'hidden_size': 96,   # match best H\n          'normalize_u': True,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99\n      }\n\n  class Wrapper:\n      def __init__(self, rank_k=320, proj_rank=36, hidden_size=96, normalize_u=True, gamma_start=0.25, gamma_end=0.99):\n          self.model = Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedLLN(\n              rank_k=rank_k,\n              proj_rank=proj_rank,\n              hidden_size=hidden_size,\n              normalize_u=normalize_u,\n              gamma_start=gamma_start,\n              gamma_end=gamma_end\n          )\n          self.needs_rng = False\n\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          return self.model.init(rng_key, dummy_input, training=True)\n\n      def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n          return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training)\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return Wrapper(\n          rank_k=int(hparams.get('rank_k',\
    \ 320)),\n          proj_rank=int(hparams.get('proj_rank', 36)),\n          hidden_size=int(hparams.get('hidden_size', 96)),\n          normalize_u=bool(hparams.get('normalize_u', True)),\n          gamma_start=float(hparams.get('gamma_start', 0.25)),\n          gamma_end=float(hparams.get('gamma_end', 0.99))\n      )\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      base = mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n      V = params['params']['V']\n      G = V.T @ V\n      I = jnp.eye(G.shape[0], dtype=G.dtype)\n      ortho = jnp.sum((G - I) ** 2)\n      return base + V_ORTHO_LAM * ortho\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate, eps=1e-8)\n      )\n```"
