    \ Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation '119' is still running. Please try again later.\n- File list for ariadne/analyses will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 100 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) +\
    \ AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | -0.026846 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 113 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 58 | -0.026893 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 95 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm + Wider Increment + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 51 | -0.026901 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 92 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 49 | -0.026910 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 110 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=40, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 57 | -0.026921 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 99 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.995): LayerNorm + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 52 | -0.026941 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 93 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg\
    \ (λ=1e-5) | Ariadne I | 50 | -0.026958 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 105 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=28, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 55 | -0.026968 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**ariadne/analyses:**\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/U_col_norms.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/U_sample.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/U_sample_idx.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/V.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/gamma_raw.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/s_alpha.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/s_beta.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_0_seed_42/summary.json\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/U_col_norms.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/U_sample.npy\n\
    - ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/U_sample_idx.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/V.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/gamma_raw.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/s_alpha.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/s_beta.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_1_seed_43/summary.json\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/U_col_norms.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/U_sample.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/U_sample_idx.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/V.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/gamma_raw.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/s_alpha.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/s_beta.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_2_seed_44/summary.json\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/U_col_norms.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/U_sample.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/U_sample_idx.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/V.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/gamma_raw.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/s_alpha.npy\n- ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/s_beta.npy\n\
    - ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_3_seed_45/summary.json\n\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 65 | 762 |\n| 64 | 983 |\n| 63 | 970 |\n| 62 | 833 |\n| 61 | 2360 |\n| 60 (Protected) | 2699 |\n| 59 | 3228 |\n| 58 | 2588 |\n| 57 | 2846 |\n| 56 | 2884 |\n| 55 | 2624 |\n| 54 | 2009 |\n| 53 | 2436 |\n| 52 | 2490 |\n| 51 | 3512 |\n| 50 | 1938 |\n| 49 | 2726 |\n| 48 (Protected) | 2340 |\n| 47 | 1493 |\n| 46 | 4054 |\n| 45 | 1817 |\n| 44 | 3549 |\n| 43 | 2586 |\n| 42 | 1582 |\n| 41 | 1173 |\n| 40 (Protected) | 4637 |\n| 26 (Protected) | 6319 |\n| 7 (Protected) | 1311 |\n| 6 (Protected) | 2403 |\n| 5 | 324 |\n| 4 | 440 |\n| 3 (Protected) | 644 |\n| 2 | 203 |\n| 1 (Protected) | 559 |\n| 0 (Protected) | 902 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single\
