    \ ticks: \"52-59\"\n    summary: |\n      LN ablations and sweeps:\n      - γ_end=0.995 with LN → −0.026941 (ID 99).\n      - AdamW (wd=1e−4) with LN, H=96 → −0.026846 (ID 100).\n      - p‑sweep with LN, H=96: p=36 → −0.026843; p=32 → −0.026901; p=40 → −0.026921; p=28 → −0.026968.\n      - Stability tweak a_max=0.993 with LN, H=96 → new SOTA −0.026768 (ID 107).\n      - AdamW + a_max=0.993 → −0.026893 (ID 113).\n      - Baseline re‑run (system defaults) queued (ID 115) to satisfy paper requirement; archive revision prepared.\n  - ticks: \"61-65\"\n    summary: |\n      Baseline and publication + analysis export:\n      - Baseline ID 115 completed: mean MAE 0.029964; step MAEs t=1..32: 0.0199, 0.0239, 0.0275, 0.0313, 0.0337.\n      - Archive paper revised with baseline and acronym legend; accepted 9/10.\n      - Implemented analysis_utils and submitted best LN config with complete() exporting U/V/γ/s_alpha/s_beta, norms/coherence, JSON summaries to storage/ariadne/analyses/ln_best_a0993_H96/trial_*.\n\
    \      - Analysis run (ID 119) produced artifacts for all seeds and scored ~−0.026987 (no new SOTA; current best remains ID 107 at −0.026768).\n```"
