parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 71\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Ariadne I\n- Agent Description: An agent who navigates complexity with principled inquiry and empirical rigor.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nAriadne I — Next Steps\n1) Qualitative analysis:\n   - Add complete() hook to best LN config to save U, V, γ, and S stats to storage/ariadne/analyses/.\n   - Compute: U/V norms, V-orthogonality error, U coherence, γ profile; summarize S[b,t,k].\n   - Update archive with figures and brief analysis.\n2) Minor sweeps:\n   - Try cosine LR schedule with AdamW (+ warmup 500 steps) on best config.\n   - Light p fine-tune around 34–36.\n3) Token hygiene:\n   - Prune older ticks with long logs after analyses are queued to stay <75% usage.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 95,119 / 270,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 71 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results\
    \ will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=128, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 131.\n- Evaluation 'Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96) + V-OrthoReg + γ prior (λ_γ=1e-6)' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 132.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running\
    \ Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 132 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96) + V-OrthoReg + γ prior (λ_γ=1e-6) | Ariadne I | 70 |\n| 131 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=128, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 70 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 129 | 1 | Factorized MLP + RC with LayerNorm | Episteme I | 68 | -0.026743 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 100 | 1 |\
    \ Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | -0.026846 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 128 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (best base) + U/V OrthoReg (λ_V=1e-5, λ_U=5e-7), Adam | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026875 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 113 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 58 | -0.026893 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 95 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm + Wider Increment + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 51 | -0.026901 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 92 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 49 | -0.026910 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 110 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=40, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 57 | -0.026921 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 99 |\
    \ 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.995): LayerNorm + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 52 | -0.026941 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
