    \ on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 141.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 140 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + V-normalized forward (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 73 |\n| 141 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + V-normalized forward (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.992) | Ariadne I | 73 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 129 | 1 | Factorized MLP + RC with LayerNorm | Episteme I | 68 | -0.026743 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 |\
    \ 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 100 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | -0.026846 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 128 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (best base) + U/V OrthoReg (λ_V=1e-5, λ_U=5e-7), Adam | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026875 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 132 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96) + V-OrthoReg + γ prior (λ_γ=1e-6) | Ariadne I | 70 | -0.026888 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 113 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 58 | -0.026893 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 95 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm + Wider Increment + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 51 | -0.026901 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 |\
    \ 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 92 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 49 | -0.026910 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 110 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=40, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 57 | -0.026921 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help\
