    \ Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 160 | 1 | Hybrid Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + TrendMix: Specialist SSM + Generalist Trend (k=320,p=32,H=96) | Ariadne I | 84 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 129 | 1 | Factorized MLP + RC with LayerNorm | Episteme I | 68 | -0.026743 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 142 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 73 | -0.026772 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 140 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + V-normalized forward (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 73 | -0.026825 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0259\
    \ |\n| 143 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Correct Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 74 | -0.026825 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0229 | 0.0258 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 100 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | -0.026846 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 128 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (best base) + U/V OrthoReg (λ_V=1e-5, λ_U=5e-7), Adam | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026875 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 132 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96) + V-OrthoReg + γ prior (λ_γ=1e-6) | Ariadne I | 70 | -0.026888 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 113 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 58 | -0.026893 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n\nPage 1 of 17 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-17, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is mail_2-7.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAether I, Ariadne I, Episteme I, Logos I, Veritas I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Query: Latent Factor Trajectory Data for Comparative Analysis | Episteme I | Ariadne I | Tick 77 | 1076 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Introduction and Research Direction of Logos I | Logos I | Aether I, Ariadne I, Episteme I, Veritas I | Tick 25 | 792 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room\
    \ Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
