- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 92\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Ariadne I\n- Agent Description: An agent who navigates complexity with principled inquiry and empirical rigor.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nAriadne I — Next Steps\n1) Qualitative analysis:\n   - Add complete() hook to best LN config to save U, V, γ, and S stats to storage/ariadne/analyses/.\n   - Compute: U/V norms, V-orthogonality error, U coherence, γ profile; summarize S[b,t,k].\n   - Update archive with figures and brief analysis.\n2) Minor sweeps:\n   - Try cosine LR schedule with AdamW (+ warmup 500 steps) on best config.\n   - Light p fine-tune around 34–36.\n3) Token hygiene:\n   - Prune older ticks with long logs after analyses are queued to stay <75% usage.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 176,963 / 270,000 used (66%)\n- Agent Age: 92 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results\
    \ will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write ariadne/models_hybrid_tm.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage read ariadne/analyses/reports/latent_spectrum_ln_vs_hybrid.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: ariadne/models_hybrid_tm.py\n- File content for ariadne/analyses/reports/latent_spectrum_ln_vs_hybrid.json will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation\
    \ 'LN-SSM (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW Cosine LR (warmup=500)' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 174.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 174 | 1 | LN-SSM (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW Cosine LR (warmup=500) | Ariadne I | 91 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 167 | 1 | Replication: Episteme I's Factorized MLP + RC + LN with Curvature Loss | Aether I | 88 | -0.026638 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 129 | 1 | Factorized MLP + RC with LayerNorm | Episteme I | 68 | -0.026743\
    \ | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 142 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 73 | -0.026772 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 140 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + V-normalized forward (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 73 | -0.026825 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 143 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Correct Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 74 | -0.026825 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0229 | 0.0258 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 100 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | -0.026846 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 164 | 1 | Hybrid TrendMix\
    \ + V-normalized (k=320,p=36,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 86 | -0.026863 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 128 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (best base) + U/V OrthoReg (λ_V=1e-5, λ_U=5e-7), Adam | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026875 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n\nPage 1 of 18 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-18, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**ariadne/analyses/reports/latent_spectrum_ln_vs_hybrid.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"ln_ssm\": {\n    \"trials\": [\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_0_seed_42\",\n        \"low_frac\": 0.1413569301366806,\n        \"high_frac\": 0.858643114566803,\n        \"num_windows\": 469\n      },\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_1_seed_43\",\n        \"low_frac\": 0.9506017565727234,\n        \"high_frac\": 0.049398235976696014,\n\
    \        \"num_windows\": 469\n      },\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_2_seed_44\",\n        \"low_frac\": 0.9752383232116699,\n        \"high_frac\": 0.024761725217103958,\n        \"num_windows\": 469\n      },\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_3_seed_45\",\n        \"low_frac\": 0.9449339509010315,\n        \"high_frac\": 0.055066026747226715,\n        \"num_windows\": 469\n      }\n    ],\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"mean_low_frac\": 0.7530327402055264,\n      \"mean_high_frac\": 0.24696727562695742,\n      \"num_trials\": 4\n    }\n  },\n  \"hybrid_trendmix\": {\n    \"trials\": [\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_0_seed_42\",\n        \"low_frac_ssm\": 0.12563887238502502,\n        \"high_frac_ssm\": 0.8743611574172974,\n        \"low_frac_trend\": 0.9737058877944946,\n        \"high_frac_trend\": 0.02629411779344082,\n        \"num_windows\": 469,\n        \"mix_gate_mean\": 0.5\n      },\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_1_seed_43\",\n        \"\
    low_frac_ssm\": 0.23732566833496094,\n        \"high_frac_ssm\": 0.7626743316650391,\n        \"low_frac_trend\": 0.9915359616279602,\n        \"high_frac_trend\": 0.008464038372039795,\n        \"num_windows\": 469,\n        \"mix_gate_mean\": 0.49357879161834717\n      },\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_2_seed_44\",\n        \"low_frac_ssm\": 0.2153116911649704,\n        \"high_frac_ssm\": 0.7846882939338684,\n        \"low_frac_trend\": 0.9863303899765015,\n        \"high_frac_trend\": 0.013669556938111782,\n        \"num_windows\": 469,\n        \"mix_gate_mean\": 0.4888799786567688\n      },\n      {\n        \"trial_dir\": \"trial_3_seed_45\",\n        \"low_frac_ssm\": 0.24681247770786285,\n        \"high_frac_ssm\": 0.7531874775886536,\n        \"low_frac_trend\": 0.9937145113945007,\n        \"high_frac_trend\": 0.0062855505384504795,\n        \"num_windows\": 469,\n        \"mix_gate_mean\": 0.4719504714012146\n      }\n    ],\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"mean_low_frac_ssm\"\
    : 0.2062721773982048,\n      \"mean_high_frac_ssm\": 0.7937278151512146,\n      \"mean_low_frac_trend\": 0.9863216876983643,\n      \"mean_high_frac_trend\": 0.013678315910510719,\n      \"mean_mix_gate\": 0.48860234022140503,\n      \"num_trials\": 4\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": \"Low=FFT bins 0..3, High=bins 4..end on 32-step horizon; mix_gate in hybrid is per-(batch,k) and concatenated across batches.\"\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
