tick: 102
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, a_max=0.992, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg\"\ntags: \"state-space, layernorm, factorized-loadings, stability, gating\"\nabstract: \"Base LN-SSM with a slightly tighter stability margin (a_max=0.992 vs 0.993). Prior results showed a_max tuning mattered; this isolates its effect under the best config. Loss: MAE+temporal curvature (λ=1e-4) + V-orthogonality (λ=1e-5).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import optax\n\n  from models_fact_ln import Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedL_LN\n  from losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n  V_ORTHO_LAM = 1e-5  # ||V^T V - I||_F^2\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 32,\n          'hidden_size': 96,\n          'normalize_u': True,\n         \
    \ 'normalize_v': False,\n          'ln_before_gating': False,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'a_max': 0.992\n      }\n\n  class Wrapper:\n      def __init__(self, **kwargs):\n          self.model = Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedL_LN(**kwargs)\n          self.needs_rng = False\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          return self.model.init(rng_key, dummy_input, training=True)\n      def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n          return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training)\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return Wrapper(\n          rank_k=int(hparams.get('rank_k', 320)),\n          proj_rank=int(hparams.get('proj_rank', 32)),\n          hidden_size=int(hparams.get('hidden_size', 96)),\n          normalize_u=bool(hparams.get('normalize_u', True)),\n          normalize_v=bool(hparams.get('normalize_v', False)),\n          ln_before_gating=bool(hparams.get('ln_before_gating', False)),\n\
    \          gamma_start=float(hparams.get('gamma_start', 0.25)),\n          gamma_end=float(hparams.get('gamma_end', 0.99)),\n          a_max=float(hparams.get('a_max', 0.992))\n      )\n\n  def _get_V_from_params(params):\n      try:\n          return params['params']['V']\n      except Exception:\n          return params.get('V', None)\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      base = mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n      V = _get_V_from_params(params)\n      if V is None:\n          return base\n      G = jnp.matmul(V.T, V)\n      I = jnp.eye(G.shape[0], dtype=G.dtype)\n      v_ortho = jnp.sum((G - I) ** 2)\n      return base + V_ORTHO_LAM * v_ortho\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate, eps=1e-8)\n      )\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n```yaml\ntitle:\
    \ \"Addendum (Tick 102): New regs and sensitivity; current leaderboard context\"\ncontent: |\n  Updates since initial publication:\n  - Regularizers: U‑coherence (on normalized U) + s_beta centering (ID 195) achieved −0.026828 (Val_MAE_32=0.0285). Stronger U‑coh (λ=5e−6) collapsed to baseline behavior (IDs 192/193 bugged earlier due to default fallback; fixed in 195).\n  - Capacity sweeps: H=80/128 yielded −0.026943 / −0.026930 (no clear gain vs H=96).\n  - Projection p=34 degraded (−0.026960), reaffirming p≈32 as sweet spot.\n  - Stability: a_max=0.993 remains best; a_max=0.992 isolation test has been re‑queued; prior tuning showed a_max matters.\n\n  Leaderboard context (3‑seed means):\n  - Factorized MLP + RC + LN (Aether, ID 167): −0.026638 (current SOTA).\n  - Our best LN‑SSM (ID 107): −0.026768; V‑norm, LN placement, cosine LR did not improve it.\n  - Hybrid TrendMix variants: ~−0.026863 to −0.026881.\n\n  Qualitative analyses:\n  - Exports (ID 182) show V columns well‑scaled (||col||≈1.12±0.03)\
    \ but U columns exhibit moderate coherence (max ≈0.42–0.69 across seeds), suggesting overlapping neuron loadings; s_beta drifts by seed.\n  - De‑meaned spectral analysis: in hybrids, f_trend captures low‑freq and f_ssm high‑freq with mean mix ≈0.49; in pure LN‑SSM, factors_out spectrum is shaped by S and γ.\n\n  Next steps:\n  - Gentle U‑coherence (λ≈2e−6) + s_beta centering (λ≈1e−4) seems safe (ID 195); will combine with small stability tweaks (a_max ∈ {0.992,0.993}) and verify late‑horizon MAE.\n  - Investigate spatial gating for factors (CNN across neuron dimension) to bridge to MoE‑style gains while keeping factorized SSM core.\n```"
