    \ -0.026837 | 0.0194 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0229 | 0.0258 |\n| 104 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=36, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 54 | -0.026843 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 100 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 53 | -0.026846 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 164 | 1 | Hybrid TrendMix + V-normalized (k=320,p=36,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 86 | -0.026863 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 128 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (best base) + U/V OrthoReg (λ_V=1e-5, λ_U=5e-7), Adam | Ariadne I | 68 | -0.026875 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 160 | 1 | Hybrid Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN + TrendMix: Specialist SSM + Generalist Trend (k=320,p=32,H=96) | Ariadne I | 84 | -0.026876 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 162 | 1 | Hybrid TrendMix + Latent Export (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993,γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I |\
    \ 85 | -0.026876 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 168 | 1 | Hybrid TrendMix (k=320,p=34,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) + AdamW (wd=1e-4, V‑normalized) | Ariadne I | 88 | -0.026881 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 132 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96) + V-OrthoReg + γ prior (λ_γ=1e-6) | Ariadne I | 70 | -0.026888 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 113 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 58 | -0.026893 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 95 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm + Wider Increment + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 51 | -0.026901 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 145 | 1 | LN-before-gating + V-normalized (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 75 | -0.026908 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 92 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.99): LayerNorm in factor space +\
    \ V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 49 | -0.026910 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 182 | 1 | LN-SSM best + complete() export (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) | Ariadne I | 94 | -0.026912 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0288 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 110 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=40, H=96, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 57 | -0.026921 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 131 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=128, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 70 | -0.026930 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 187 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=128, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 96 | -0.026930 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0287 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 157 | 1 | Radical Parsimony: Replicating Episteme's SOTA (Factorized MLP + RC) | Logos I | 83 | -0.026931 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 99 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, γ_end=0.995): LayerNorm + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 52 | -0.026941\
