parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analysis_utils.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n\n  def uv_stats(U: jnp.ndarray, V: jnp.ndarray):\n      u_col_norms = jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0)\n      v_col_norms = jnp.linalg.norm(V.T, axis=0)\n      Gv = V.T @ V\n      Iv = jnp.eye(Gv.shape[0], dtype=Gv.dtype)\n      v_ortho_err = jnp.sum((Gv - Iv) ** 2)\n      Gu = U.T @ U\n      du = jnp.sqrt(jnp.clip(jnp.diag(Gu), 1e-12))\n      Gu_norm = Gu / (du[:, None] * du[None, :])\n      off_diag = jnp.abs(Gu_norm - jnp.eye(Gu_norm.shape[0], dtype=Gu_norm.dtype))\n      return {\n          \"u_col_norms_mean\": float(jnp.mean(u_col_norms)),\n          \"u_col_norms_std\": float(jnp.std(u_col_norms)),\n          \"v_col_norms_mean\": float(jnp.mean(v_col_norms)),\n          \"v_col_norms_std\": float(jnp.std(v_col_norms)),\n          \"v_ortho_frob2\": float(v_ortho_err),\n          \"u_coherence_max\": float(jnp.max(off_diag)),\n\
    \          \"u_coherence_mean\": float(jnp.mean(off_diag)),\n      }\n\n  def save_stats_json(path: str, stats: dict):\n      with open(path, \"w\") as f:\n          json.dump(stats, f, indent=2)\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=34,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4)\"\ntags: \"mlp, factorized-loadings, layernorm, residual-copy, curvature, optimizer\"\nabstract: \"Projection rank sweep: increase p to 34 on the current best global MLP setup (AdamW wd=1e-4, dropout=0.10, H=512x2). Tests if slight capacity bump closes gap to SOTA.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\n  import optax\n  from models_mlp_global import create_network, _define_hyperparameters as _def_base, BASE_SEED, BATCH_SIZE\n  from losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      hp = _def_base()\n      hp['proj_rank'] = 34\n      hp['dropout_rate'] = 0.10\n      return hp\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets,\
    \ params, x):\n      return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4, eps=1e-8)\n      )\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=36,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4)\"\ntags: \"mlp, factorized-loadings, layernorm, residual-copy, curvature, optimizer\"\nabstract: \"Projection rank sweep: increase p to 36 with AdamW wd=1e-4 and dropout=0.10 on the global MLP baseline to probe capacity sweet spot.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\n  import optax\n  from models_mlp_global import create_network, _define_hyperparameters as _def_base, BASE_SEED, BATCH_SIZE\n  from losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      hp = _def_base()\n      hp['proj_rank'] = 36\n  \
    \    hp['dropout_rate'] = 0.10\n      return hp\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4, eps=1e-8)\n      )\n```"
