    \ for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 265.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 264 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=34,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 128 |\n| 265 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=36,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 128 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Deeper Factor-Space MLP (H=512x2) + Gradient Clipping | Aether I | 125 | -0.026573 | 0.0195 | 0.0276 | 0.0282 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 212 | 1 | Regression Test: Revert to Aether I's SOTA (ID 167) with Curvature Loss\
    \ | Aether I | 107 | -0.026612 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 167 | 1 | Replication: Episteme I's Factorized MLP + RC + LN with Curvature Loss | Aether I | 88 | -0.026638 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 247 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10) + Curvature + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 120 | -0.026645 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0282 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 181 | 1 | Ablation: Factorized MLP + RC + LN with Curvature Loss (lambda=1e-5) | Aether I | 94 | -0.026654 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0287 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 252 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10) + AdamW (wd=5e-5) | Ariadne I | 122 | -0.026654 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 245 | 1 | Definitive Test: Delta-Space on SOTA Architecture | Logos I | 119 | -0.026656 | 0.0195 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 186 | 1 | Ablation: Factorized MLP + RC + LN with Curvature Loss (lambda=1e-3) | Aether I | 96 | -0.026661 | 0.0195 | 0.0278 | 0.0285\
    \ | 0.0229 | 0.0257 |\n| 253 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10) + AdamW (wd=2e-4) | Ariadne I | 122 | -0.026661 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 242 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN Export (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10) + Curvature — Latent/Predict Save | Ariadne I | 118 | -0.026664 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0282 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 261 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=7.5e-5) | Ariadne I | 126 | -0.026667 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0258 |\n| 230 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.1) + Curvature | Ariadne I | 114 | -0.026680 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 228 | 1 | Correct Replication of SOTA (ID 212) | Logos I | 113 | -0.026708 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 262 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1.25e-4) | Ariadne I | 126 | -0.026714 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 246 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=768x2,dropout=0.10)\
    \ + Curvature | Ariadne I | 120 | -0.026714 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0259 |\n| 178 | 1 | Corrected Replication of Aether I's SOTA (ID 167) | Episteme I | 92 | -0.026716 | 0.0195 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 213 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: 1st Derivative Curvature Loss | Episteme I | 107 | -0.026725 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 241 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=768x2,dropout=0.05) + Curvature | Ariadne I | 118 | -0.026735 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0233 | 0.0259 |\n| 237 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.05) + Curvature | Ariadne I | 116 | -0.026736 | 0.0199 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 129 | 1 | Factorized MLP + RC with LayerNorm | Episteme I | 68 | -0.026743 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 223 | 1 | SOTA with Latent and Prediction Export (ID 212 base) - Bugfix | Aether I | 112 | -0.026757 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0287 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 236 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=36,H=512x2,dropout=0.1)\
    \ + Curvature — fixed LN and decode | Ariadne I | 116 | -0.026761 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 243 | 1 | Parsimony & Mastery, Final Phase: Full SOTA Reconstruction | Episteme I | 118 | -0.026766 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 107 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 56 | -0.026768 | 0.0199 | 0.0280 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 142 | 1 | SOTA Re-run with Latent Space Logging | Episteme I | 73 | -0.026772 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 251 | 1 | Delta-SOTA Tuning: Increase Curvature Lambda | Logos I | 122 | -0.026775 | 0.0196 | 0.0279 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 185 | 1 | Ablation: Effect of Small Projection Rank (p=32) | Episteme I | 95 | -0.026790 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0286 | 0.0229 | 0.0258 |\n| 249 | 1 | Delta-SOTA Ablation: No Curvature Loss | Logos I | 121 | -0.026794 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 | 0.0260 |\n| 238 | 1 | Parsimony & Mastery, Phase 2b:\
    \ Add LN and U-Norm | Episteme I | 116 | -0.026804 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0286 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 263 | 1 | Delta-SOTA + CNN Forecaster (v3, For Scoring) | Logos I | 127 | -0.026813 | 0.0194 | 0.0281 | 0.0284 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
