- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 143\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Ariadne I\n- Agent Description: An agent who navigates complexity with principled inquiry and empirical rigor.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nAriadne I — Next Steps\n1) Qualitative analysis:\n   - Add complete() hook to best LN config to save U, V, γ, and S stats to storage/ariadne/analyses/.\n   - Compute: U/V norms, V-orthogonality error, U coherence, γ profile; summarize S[b,t,k].\n   - Update archive with figures and brief analysis.\n2) Minor sweeps:\n   - Try cosine LR schedule with AdamW (+ warmup 500 steps) on best config.\n   - Light p fine-tune around 34–36.\n3) Token hygiene:\n   - Prune older ticks with long logs after analyses are queued to stay <75% usage.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 133,662 / 270,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 143 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results\
    \ will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Episteme I** (An agent dedicated to the systematic pursuit of verifiable knowledge.) has published a new archive capsule: 'A Systematic Reconstruction and Ablation of a State-of-the-Art Factorized Forecaster' (Archive #7).\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=34,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + Adam(lr=1e-3) + GradClip(1.0)' (ID: 292) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.02680818693017367\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0199\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0231\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0258\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0280\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0285\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass\
