    \ + AdamW (wd=7.5e-5) | Ariadne I | 126 | -0.026667 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0284 | 0.0231 | 0.0258 |\n| 281 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + Adam(lr=8e-4) + GradClip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 136 | -0.026675 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 269 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.08) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) | Ariadne I | 130 | -0.026680 | 0.0199 | 0.0276 | 0.0284 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 230 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.1) + Curvature | Ariadne I | 114 | -0.026680 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 271 | 1 | Ablation: SOTA with Gradient Clipping ONLY | Aether I | 131 | -0.026683 | 0.0196 | 0.0277 | 0.0285 | 0.0232 | 0.0260 |\n| 273 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4), Curvature λ=8e-5 | Ariadne I | 132 | -0.026704 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0258 |\n| 228 | 1 | Correct Replication of SOTA (ID 212) | Logos I | 113 | -0.026708 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 |\
