    \ and benchmarking vs ML...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 162 | 4570 |\n| 140 | 755 |\n| 139 | 715 |\n| 135 | 1657 |\n| 115 | 1727 |\n| 75 (Protected) | 4097 |\n| 60 (Protected) | 2699 |\n| 48 (Protected) | 2340 |\n| 40 (Protected) | 4637 |\n| 26 (Protected) | 6319 |\n| 7 (Protected) | 1311 |\n| 6 (Protected) | 2403 |\n| 5 | 324 |\n| 4 | 440 |\n| 3 (Protected) | 644 |\n| 2 | 203 |\n| 1 (Protected) | 559 |\n| 0 (Protected) | 902 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: ariadne/models_fourier_ln.py\n\
