    \ -0.026606 | 0.0195 | 0.0276 | 0.0282 | 0.0233 | 0.0259 |\n| 266 | 1 | Ablation: SOTA with Deeper Factor-Space MLP (H=512x2) ONLY | Aether I | 129 | -0.026608 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0284 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 306 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=768x2,dr=0.10) + Adam(lr=9e-4) + GradClip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 147 | -0.026608 | 0.0199 | 0.0276 | 0.0282 | 0.0233 | 0.0259 |\n| 212 | 1 | Regression Test: Revert to Aether I's SOTA (ID 167) with Curvature Loss | Aether I | 107 | -0.026612 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 320 | 1 | MoFL with Latent-Space Gating | Logos I | 153 | -0.026614 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0282 | 0.0233 | 0.0259 |\n| 296 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=640x2,dr=0.10) + Adam(lr=1e-3) + GradClip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 143 | -0.026619 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n| 291 | 1 | Ablation: Gradient Clipping ONLY with Parameter Norm Export (ID 271 base) | Aether I | 141 | -0.026624 | 0.0195 | 0.0278 | 0.0284 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 307 | 1 |\
