    \  |   0.026627  \n  27    |   0.025437   |   0.026710  \n  28    |   0.025289   |   0.026580  \n  29    |   0.025213   |   0.026514  \n  30    |   0.025140   |   0.026752  \n  31    |   0.025020   |   0.026530  \n  32    |   0.024963   |   0.026548  \n  33    |   0.024879   |   0.026384  \n  34    |   0.024802   |   0.026618  \n  35    |   0.024805   |   0.026394  \n  36    |   0.024706   |   0.026751  \n  37    |   0.024687   |   0.026435  \n  38    |   0.024593   |   0.026602  \n  39    |   0.024560   |   0.026487  \n  40    |   0.024462   |   0.026398  \n  41    |   0.024475   |   0.026505  \n  42    |   0.024402   |   0.026488  \n  43    |   0.024387   |   0.026492  \n  44    |   0.024326   |   0.026558  \n  45    |   0.024344   |   0.026563  \n  46    |   0.024264   |   0.027472  \n  47    |   0.024261   |   0.026724  \n  48    |   0.024274   |   0.026770  \n  49    |   0.024190   |   0.026601  \n  50    |   0.024141   |   0.026611  \n  51    |   0.024117   |   0.026627  \n  52\
    \    |   0.024112   |   0.026519  \n  53    |   0.024119   |   0.026483  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 53 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1632.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026384\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026384\nTraining time: 1640s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 370944\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032293   |   0.029406  \n   2    |   0.029154   |   0.029282  \n   3    |   0.028996   |   0.029462  \n   4    |   0.028919   |   0.029178  \n   5    |  \
    \ 0.028866   |   0.029170  \n   6    |   0.028845   |   0.029253  \n   7    |   0.028792   |   0.029008  \n   8    |   0.028662   |   0.028709  \n   9    |   0.028413   |   0.028588  \n  10    |   0.028120   |   0.028393  \n  11    |   0.027868   |   0.028061  \n  12    |   0.027646   |   0.027985  \n  13    |   0.027505   |   0.027854  \n  14    |   0.027255   |   0.027373  \n  15    |   0.026911   |   0.027313  \n  16    |   0.026665   |   0.027393  \n  17    |   0.026452   |   0.026923  \n  18    |   0.026295   |   0.026850  \n  19    |   0.026165   |   0.026872  \n  20    |   0.026065   |   0.026751  \n  21    |   0.025962   |   0.026806  \n  22    |   0.025842   |   0.026680  \n  23    |   0.025736   |   0.026556  \n  24    |   0.025645   |   0.026501  \n  25    |   0.025529   |   0.026706  \n  26    |   0.025483   |   0.026472  \n  27    |   0.025352   |   0.026500  \n  28    |   0.025257   |   0.026535  \n  29    |   0.025141   |   0.026502  \n  30    |   0.025065   |   0.026633\
    \  \n  31    |   0.025009   |   0.026652  \n  32    |   0.024929   |   0.026435  \n  33    |   0.024904   |   0.026340  \n  34    |   0.024857   |   0.026466  \n  35    |   0.024786   |   0.026461  \n  36    |   0.024732   |   0.026503  \n  37    |   0.024717   |   0.026627  \n  38    |   0.024600   |   0.026571  \n  39    |   0.024549   |   0.026542  \n  40    |   0.024648   |   0.026472  \n  41    |   0.024447   |   0.026714  \n  42    |   0.024426   |   0.026560  \n  43    |   0.024383   |   0.026456  \n  44    |   0.024351   |   0.026568  \n  45    |   0.024324   |   0.026762  \n  46    |   0.024280   |   0.026662  \n  47    |   0.024235   |   0.026499  \n  48    |   0.024228   |   0.026593  \n  49    |   0.024146   |   0.026444  \n  50    |   0.024117   |   0.026791  \n  51    |   0.024113   |   0.026793  \n  52    |   0.024072   |   0.026765  \n  53    |   0.024033   |   0.026616  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 53 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\
    \nTraining completed in 2383.2s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026340\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026340\nTraining time: 2392s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 700376cc-45d2-44d4-856f-5ca6a0a20841\nTotal time: 2756s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 13:42:29,350\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761370949350665847\n2025-10-25 13:42:29,370\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761370949370566482\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 331**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Fourier Forecaster, Phase 1: Hybrid Time-Frequency Model\n**ID:** 331\n**Tags:** fourier, fft, representation-engineering, sota, hybrid-model\n**Abstract:** This experiment tests a novel \"Fourier Forecaster\" paradigm to break the station's SOTA plateau. The hypothesis is that forecasting in the frequency domain is a more effective\
    \ representation. This model transforms the input into the frequency domain, uses a factorized MLP to predict the output spectrum, and transforms the result back to the time domain. This is combined in a hybrid architecture with a standard time-domain Residual Copy Head to capture both periodic dynamics and short-term trends.\n**Score:** -0.026470719630982503\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0195\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0255\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0275\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0284\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\nsys.path.append('storage/episteme')\nfrom fourier_forecaster import FourierForecaster\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n  \
    \  return mae + 1e-4 * curv_pen\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n    )\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return { 'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32 }\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        self.model = FourierForecaster(rank_k=hparams['rank_k'], proj_rank=hparams['proj_rank'])\n        self.needs_rng = True\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        return self.model.init({'params': rng_key, 'dropout': rng_key}, dummy_input)\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs=rngs)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE\
