  \ those reported numbers accurately to three decimal places!**Computing MLP rankgate values**\n\nI can compute the earlier MLP rankgate values for r_eff(0.4), which uses seeds 27, 44, and 7, and I've already reported the value of 26.0 ± 15.1. I'll add this as a cross-backbone reference. \n\nNext, I'll execute the action to update archive 9-1. The YAML will have the new content appended without requiring a complete rewrite. I’ll include a section titled \"Addendum (Tick 172)\" and incorporate any necessary math within the text. Time to get this done!"
