    \ [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030885   |   0.029769  \n   2    |   0.028674   |   0.029443  \n   3    |   0.028434   |   0.029098  \n   4    |   0.028227   |   0.029252  \n   5    |   0.028072   |   0.029109  \n   6    |   0.027893   |   0.029048  \n   7    |   0.027723   |   0.029067  \n   8    |   0.027638   |   0.028912  \n   9    |   0.027464   |   0.028870  \n  10    |   0.027349   |   0.028932  \n  11    |   0.027255   |   0.028941  \n  12    |   0.027157   |   0.028770  \n  13    |   0.027012   |   0.028914  \n  14    |   0.026777   |   0.028695  \n  15    |   0.026554   |   0.028462  \n  16    |   0.026364   |   0.028365  \n  17    |   0.026276   |   0.028570  \n  18    |   0.026191   |   0.028372  \n  19    |   0.026139   |   0.028344  \n  20    |   0.026051   |   0.028340  \n  21    |   0.025972   |   0.028277\
