- text: "/execute_action{goto token_management}\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"174-190\"\n    summary: |\n      Fourier/SAP program and replication reviews; results and pivot.\n      Key evaluations (3-seed means unless noted):\n      - Replication-Extend FourierForecasterLN (p=36) ID 344 → −0.026355 (strong); p=40 ID 345 → −0.026386. Aether ID 361 (p=40 ablation) → −0.026364. Logos/Aether replications consistent (IDs 346/347/395).\n      - SAP-Fourier (encoder gates over U/V): v1 ID 367 → −0.028736, v1 Pmax=40 ID 368 → −0.028629; v2 (gate-U only + const trend + γ ramp) ID 371 → −0.027717. Takeaway: gating hurt vs LN baselines.\n      - FourierMix variants and LN in factor space (IDs 336–340) underperformed best Fourier LN (~−0.02635).\n      - FourierForecasterLN v3 (amplitudes from full 4-step per-factor context): ID 379 (H=256) → −0.028045; ID 380 (H=256×2) → −0.027805. Contextual amplitude MLP helps but still far from SOTA Fourier LN.\n      -\
    \ Generic v3g imports: M=20 depth=1 ID 384 → −0.028121; M=16 depth=2 ID 385 → −0.027827 (no gain to SOTA).\n      - Scalar baselines: FForecaster-LN Base (γ=0.5) IDs 389/390 → ~−0.02866 (poor).\n      - ScalarRamp baselines (γ ramp 0.25→0.99) IDs 393/394 → ~−0.02865 (no gain).\n      - RFFT pipeline (p=36, dropout 0.05) IDs 397/398 submitted (pending at time of pruning).\n      Reviews pulled:\n      - ID 344/345/361 detailed code confirms RFFT-based Fourier LN with LayerNorm on real/imag, RC head with dropout, Adam+clip, curvature loss; sweet spot around p≈36.\n      Takeaways:\n      - Best Fourier LN remains around −0.02631 to −0.02639 (IDs 369/344/361). Our variants (SAP gates, ramp gamma, v3 amplitude MLP, RFFT tweaks) did not improve and often regressed (−0.0281 to −0.0277).\n      - Earlier non-Fourier bests: MLP line near −0.026608 (ID 306) and LN-SSM best −0.026768 (ID 107).\n      Next steps:\n      - De-emphasize SAP/gating; if pursuing Fourier, adhere closely to the proven\
    \ RFFT+LN+RC recipe (p≈36), test only minimal ablations (dropout 0.05 vs 0.10, lr 1e−3 vs 9e−4), export gamma/freq stats for analysis.\n      - Primary path: consolidate MLP SOTA replicates/ablate toward −0.02631.\n```"
