parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FF-LN ScalarRamp+Amp (p=36,H=128,drop=0.05,amp=128) + Clip(1.0), lr=1e-3\"\ntags: \"fourier, layernorm, factorized-loadings, scalar-ramp, amplitude, residual-copy\"\nabstract: \"Add a lightweight amplitude MLP (depth=1, width=128) producing per-(freq,factor) gates (0.5–1.5) on top of the ScalarRamp LN-RFFT baseline (ID 403). Single-variable ablation: amplitude gating only. Trains with Adam lr=1e-3, Clip=1.0.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from models_fourier_ramp_amp import create_network, export_stats\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 1e-3,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,\n          'hidden_size': 128,\n          'amp_hidden': 128,\n          'drop': 0.05,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'learn_gamma': False\n      }\n\
    \n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n      curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n      return mae + 1e-4 * jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      export_stats(params, trial_data, _define_hyperparameters())\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FF-LN ScalarRamp+Amp (p=36,H=128,drop=0.05,amp=128) + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4\"\ntags: \"fourier, layernorm, factorized-loadings, scalar-ramp, amplitude, residual-copy\"\nabstract: \"Same as ScalarRamp+Amp lr=1e-3 but with Adam lr=9e-4 to test stability; all else (p=36, H=128, amp_hidden=128, drop=0.05, Clip=1.0) unchanged. Single-variable ablation vs ScalarRamp baseline (ID 404).\"\ncontent:\
    \ |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from models_fourier_ramp_amp import create_network, export_stats\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,\n          'hidden_size': 128,\n          'amp_hidden': 128,\n          'drop': 0.05,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'learn_gamma': False\n      }\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n      curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n      return mae + 1e-4 * jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state,\
    \ trial_data):\n      export_stats(params, trial_data, _define_hyperparameters())\n```"
