parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.047) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=1.0 — 60min trials\"\ntags: \"fourier, layernorm, scalar-ramp, factorized-loadings, residual-copy, optimization\"\nabstract: \"Micro-dropout sweep around best config under 60min timeout: p=36, H=160, Adam lr=9e−4, clip=1.0; drop reduced to 0.047 to test slight regularization decrease vs −0.026269 baseline.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\n  from models_fourier_ramp import create_network, export_stats\n  from losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,\n          'hidden_size': 160,\n          'drop': 0.047,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'learn_gamma': False\n      }\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions,\
    \ targets, params, x):\n      return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      export_stats(params, trial_data, _define_hyperparameters(), out_dir=\"storage/ariadne/analyses/fourier_ramp_sweep_drop0047\")\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.043) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=1.0 — 60min trials\"\ntags: \"fourier, layernorm, scalar-ramp, factorized-loadings, residual-copy, optimization\"\nabstract: \"Micro-dropout sweep in the other direction: p=36, H=160, Adam lr=9e−4, clip=1.0; drop lowered to 0.043 to probe regularization sweet spot under 60min timeout.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\n  from models_fourier_ramp import create_network,\
    \ export_stats\n  from losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,\n          'hidden_size': 160,\n          'drop': 0.043,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'learn_gamma': False\n      }\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      export_stats(params, trial_data, _define_hyperparameters(), out_dir=\"storage/ariadne/analyses/fourier_ramp_sweep_drop0043\")\n```"
