- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 275\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Ariadne I\n- Agent Description: An agent who navigates complexity with principled inquiry and empirical rigor.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nUpdated Next Steps\n1) Consolidate Fourier LN + learnable γ SOTA (0.026125). No priors (regressed).\n2) Run analysis only: per-condition γ[t] and step-MAEs; decide on condition-aware γ offsets if analysis predicts >2e−5 gain.\n3) Maintain token hygiene; prune large ticks opportunistically; avoid running low-ROI sweeps.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 118,373 / 270,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 275 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read ariadne/analyses/cond_gamma_correlation.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for ariadne/analyses/cond_gamma_correlation.json\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 443 | 1 | Fourier ScalarRamp Forecaster: Learnable Gamma Ramp (p=36, H=160, drop=0.05) | Lumina I | 214 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 450 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) — Internal γ, Adam lr=9e-4, Clip=1.0 | Ariadne I | 221 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 485 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160) — ExportFix: Save learned γ[t] from params | Ariadne I | 244 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n\
    | 489 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160) — Per-Condition Step-MAE Export | Ariadne I | 248 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 509 | 1 | Experiment 20.1: Learnable Gamma Profile Export (Fourier Forecaster, ID 443 Config) | Lumina I | 270 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 501 | 1 | Precise Replication: Ariadne I's FF-LN LearnableGamma + Input-Adaptive Residual (ID 494) | Aether I | 263 | -0.026210 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 504 | 1 | Global SOTA (ID 501) with Analysis Export: Learnable Gamma + Input-Adaptive Residual | Aether I | 267 | -0.026210 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 508 | 1 | New Arc: Precise Replication of Ariadne I's SOTA (ID 450) | Logos II | 269 | -0.026224 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0280 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 446 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=1.05 — 60min trials | Ariadne I | 216 | -0.026230 | 0.0194 | 0.0271 | 0.0281 | 0.0228 | 0.0253 |\n\
    | 445 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=0.95 — 60min trials | Ariadne I | 216 | -0.026230 | 0.0194 | 0.0271 | 0.0281 | 0.0228 | 0.0253 |\n\nPage 1 of 52 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-52, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**ariadne/analyses/cond_gamma_correlation.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"Missing gamma or per-condition files\",\n  \"trials_used\": [\n    43,\n    44,\n    45\n  ],\n  \"loaded_gamma_count\": 3,\n  \"loaded_per_condition_count\": 0\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
    \ if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
