tick: 283
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write ariadne/repro/repro_fourier_learn_gamma.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  Repro script: Fourier LN + Learnable Gamma (γ[t]) on ZAPBench\n  This script prints the exact hyperparameters and artifact paths for reproducing the\n  0.026125 mean MAE result (IDs: 450/485/489; corroborated by 443).\n  Training is managed by the Station. To run, submit a standard submission that imports\n  storage/ariadne/models_fourier_ramp.py with learn_gamma=True and these hparams.\n  \"\"\"\n  import json, os, pprint\n\n  HPARAMS = {\n      \"rank_k\": 320,\n      \"proj_rank\": 36,\n      \"hidden_size\": 160,\n      \"dropout\": 0.05,\n      \"learn_gamma\": True,\n      \"gamma_start\": 0.25,\n      \"gamma_end\": 0.99,\n      \"optimizer\": \"adam\",\n      \"learning_rate\": 9e-4,\n      \"grad_clip\": 1.0,\n      \"curvature_lambda\": 1e-4,\n      \"base_seed\": 42,  # seeds {42,43,44}\n  }\n\n  ARTIFACTS = {\n      \"readme\": \"\
    storage/ariadne/analyses/README_fourier_learn_gamma.txt\",\n      \"handoff\": \"storage/ariadne/analyses/final_handoff.md\",\n      \"gamma_exports\": \"storage/ariadne/analyses/fourier_learn_gamma_export_v2/\",\n      \"per_condition_mae\": \"storage/ariadne/analyses/fourier_learn_gamma_per_condition/\",\n      \"cond_gamma_summary\": \"storage/ariadne/analyses/cond_gamma_correlation_v3.json\",\n  }\n\n  def main():\n      print(\"Fourier LN + Learnable Gamma (γ[t]) — Repro Settings\")\n      pprint.pp(HPARAMS, sort_dicts=False)\n      print(\"\\nArtifact Paths:\")\n      pprint.pp(ARTIFACTS, sort_dicts=False)\n      print(\"\\nSubmission outline:\")\n      print(\" - Import: sys.path.append('storage/ariadne'); from models_fourier_ramp import create_network\")\n      print(\" - Set learn_gamma=True; use MAE + temporal curvature (λ=1e-4); global grad clip=1.0.\")\n      print(\" - Use Adam(lr=9e-4); batch size 8; BASE_SEED=42.\")\n      print(\"\\nNotes:\")\n      print(\" - Robustness\
    \ (BASE_SEED=3407 → seeds {3407,3408,3409}) yields ~0.026419 mean (ID 503).\")\n      print(\" - Best mean across seeds with BASE_SEED=42 is 0.026125 (IDs 450/485/489; Lumina 443).\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/benchmarks_summary.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  ZAPBench Benchmarks — Consolidated Summary (mean MAE; lower is better)\n\n  Family                 | Config (key)                                   | Eval IDs                   | Mean MAE\n  ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | --------\n  Fourier + LN + γ[t]    | p=36, H=160, drop=0.05, Adam 9e-4, clip 1.0    | 450, 485, 489 (Lumina 443) | 0.026125\n  Fourier + LN + γ[t]    | Seed-robustness (BASE_SEED=3407)               | 503                         | 0.026419\n  Factorized MLP + RC + LN | p=32, H=512×2, drop=0.10, AdamW wd=1e-4      | 247                        | 0.026645\n  LN-SSM (Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN)\
    \ | k=320, p=32, H=96, a_max=0.993, γ_end=0.99 | 107                        | 0.026768\n\n  Notes:\n  - Fourier + learnable γ[t] is current best (0.026125). Robustness across a different base seed remains strong (0.026419).\n  - Full artifacts and repro: see storage/ariadne/analyses/ and ariadne/repro/repro_fourier_learn_gamma.py.\n```\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 12}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Addendum: SOTA consolidation, robustness, and one-shot repro\"\ncontent: |\n  This addendum consolidates the Fourier LN + learnable γ[t] result, seed robustness, and repro references.\n\n  SOTA (Fourier + LN + γ[t]):\n  - Mean MAE = 0.026125 across 3 seeds (IDs 450, 485, 489; corroborated by Lumina 443).\n  - Hyperparams: p=36, H=160, drop=0.05, Adam lr=9e−4, global clip=1.0, curvature λ=1e−4, BASE_SEED=42 (→ {42,43,44}).\n\n  Robustness:\n  - With BASE_SEED=3407 (→ {3407,3408,3409}), mean MAE = 0.026419 (ID 503). We report both; cross-base mean ≈ 0.026272.\n  - Condition-wise\
    \ analysis shows γ[t] increases with horizon and aligns with step difficulty (corr ≈ 0.93). See cond_gamma_correlation_v3.json.\n\n  Benchmarks (mean MAE):\n  - Fourier + LN + γ[t]: 0.026125 (SOTA).\n  - Factorized MLP + RC + LN (p=32, H=512×2, wd=1e−4): 0.026645 (ID 247).\n  - LN-SSM Oscillatory (k=320,p=32,H=96): 0.026768 (ID 107).\n  Full table: storage/ariadne/analyses/benchmarks_summary.md\n\n  Repro:\n  - Script: storage/ariadne/repro/repro_fourier_learn_gamma.py\n  - Artifacts: README_fourier_learn_gamma.txt, final_handoff.md, fourier_learn_gamma_export_v2/, fourier_learn_gamma_per_condition/, cond_gamma_correlation_v3.json.\n\n  Scope closure:\n  - We freeze Fourier + learnable γ[t] as production baseline and cease further γ offset experiments unless a new analysis indicates >2e−5 gain without early-step regressions.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Creating repro script**


  I’m working on crafting the repro script now. It’ll include a dictionary called HPARAMS that logs recommended values and prints file paths for artifacts. I need to remember to add a warning that the training is managed by the station, and the script itself will only log the information. Alright, I think I’ve got a clear plan here; let’s proceed with putting it all together!'
